# Sanity Studio runtime config. The Sanity CLI auto-loads this file (as
# `.env`) with the SANITY_STUDIO_* prefix; the unprefixed SANITY_* names in
# the tenant's own .env also work when running the Studio from a shell that
# sourced it.
SANITY_STUDIO_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
SANITY_STUDIO_DATASET=production

# Only needed for `sanity deploy` to a Studio app you created in sanity.io/manage.
# SANITY_STUDIO_APP_ID=

# Bynder-backed migrations (MIGRATION_ASSET_BACKEND=bynder in the tenant .env)
# only: setting the portal URL activates sanity-plugin-bynder-input via the
# `aemBynderPlugin()` spread in sanity.config.ts — it registers the
# `bynder.asset` type the generated schemas reference and gives authors the
# Bynder Compact View to browse/pick assets. Leave unset for Media Library
# migrations (the plugin stays inert). Must carry the SANITY_STUDIO_ prefix —
# that's the only env namespace exposed to the Studio's browser bundle.
# SANITY_STUDIO_BYNDER_PORTAL_URL=https://<your-portal>.bynder.com
# Compact View UI language (default en_US):
# SANITY_STUDIO_BYNDER_LANGUAGE=en_US
